counterexample:
Raw textual data with no structural invariants, such as comments or descriptions:
```rust
struct UserSession {
    profile_bio: String,
}
```

fix:
Parse the raw input into a structured, validated newtype as early as possible.
```rust
struct EmailAddress(String);

impl EmailAddress {
    fn parse(s: String) -> Result<Self, &'static str> {
        if s.contains('@') { Ok(EmailAddress(s)) } else { Err("Invalid email") }
    }
}
```
